{"id":"aebec725a306c229","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing5 Countable Support Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition — ZFC Forcing5 Countable Support Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition — ZFC Forcing5 Countable Support Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing5-countable-support-condition — ZFC Forcing5 Countable Support Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,p,\\vec{\\dot Q}\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,p,\\vec{\\dot Q}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (countable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5CountableSupportCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5CountableSupportCondition}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5CountableSupportCondition}_S(\\alpha,p,\\vec{\\dot Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land p:\\alpha\\to V\\land\\vec{\\dot Q}:\\alpha\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\bigl(\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha\\mid p(\\xi)\\neq\\mathbf1_{\\dot Q_\\xi}\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5CountableSupportCondition}_S(\\alpha,p,\\vec{\\dot Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land p:\\alpha\\to V\\land\\vec{\\dot Q}:\\alpha\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\bigl(\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha\\mid p(\\xi)\\neq\\mathbf1_{\\dot Q_\\xi}\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countable support now uses the canonical countability predicate and requires both <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> and the iterand sequence to be functions on the iteration length.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":